# Treasure Map // Treasure Cove. "{1}, {T}: Scry 1. Put a landmark counter on this artifact. Then if there are three or more
# landmark counters on it, remove those counters, transform this artifact, and create three Treasure tokens."
# Turn 1: both Moxes are tapped to cast it, so the {1} can't be paid (CR 601.2h). Turn 3: it is activated, the scry bottoms the
# Lightning Bolt, and it is tapped for the cost, so it can't be activated again though an Island is untapped (CR 602.2).
# Turn 5: a second counter, still an artifact. Turn 7: the third counter - the counters come off, it transforms (CR 701.27a)
# and three Treasures come with it. Treasure Cove stays tapped, so "{T}, Sacrifice a Treasure: Draw a card" is refused.
# Turn 9: a Mox Jet can't be sacrificed for it, a Treasure can and draws one card. Turn 11: "{T}: Add {C}".

